<title>USA: Host Funding Inc raises qtly payout.</title>
<headline>Host Funding Inc raises qtly payout.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Host Funding Inc Friday said it raised its quarterly dividend to $0.24 a share from $0.2375, payable February 18, to shareholders of record.</p>
</text>
